{"parentUuid":"33a642db-8a7d-4838-bfbc-fc7e873e87da","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_4f4ddab527ee4229891565e4","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"所有文件已创建完成。让我给你一个清晰的总结：\n\n---\n\n## 已完成：参赛板级适配初始化\n\n### 创建的文件结构\n\n```\nboard/contest_board/\n├── CMakeLists.txt              # 顶层构建\n├── Kconfig                     # 板级配置选项\n├── README.md                   # 板级说明文档\n├── configs/nsh/defconfig       # NSH 最小配置 (核心!)\n├── include/board.h             # 时钟树、LED、引脚定义\n├── scripts/\n│   ├── flash.ld                # 链接脚本 (SRAM-only, 0x34000400)\n│   └── Make.defs               # ARMv8-M 工具链配置\n└── src/\n    ├── CMakeLists.txt          # 源文件构建\n    ├── Make.defs               # 源文件 Make\n    ├── contest_board.h         # 板级私有头文件 (LED GPIO)\n    ├── stm32_boot.c            # 启动初始化入口\n    ├── stm32_bringup.c         # 外设初始化\n    ├── stm32_autoleds.c        # 自动 LED 控制\n    └── stm32_userleds.c        # 用户 LED 控制\n```\n\n### 关键配置说明\n\n**defconfig** 核心设置：\n- `CONFIG_ARCH_BOARD_CUSTOM=y` — 使用 vendor 自定义板\n- `CONFIG_ARCH_BOARD_CUSTOM_DIR=\"../vendor/openvela/boards/contest2026_224_board\"` — 通过 manifest 软链映射\n- `CONFIG_ARCH_CHIP_STM32N657X0=y` — 引用 NuttX 已有的 STM32N6 芯片支持\n- `CONFIG_ARCH_ARMV8M=y` — Cortex-M55 架构\n- `CONFIG_RAM_START=0x34000400` — SRAM 起始地址\n\n### 映射关系\n\nmanifest 中已有：\n```xml\n<linkfile src=\"board/contest_board\" dest=\"vendor/openvela/boards/contest2026_224_board\"/>\n```\n\n所以 `board/contest_board/` → 软链到 → `vendor/openvela/boards/contest2026_224_board/`\n\n### 下一步：编译测试\n\n```bash\ncd /home/warner/openvela\n./build.sh vendor/openvela/boards/contest2026_224_board/configs/nsh [-j8]\n```\n\n如果编译通过，你就有了一个可以在 DEV 模式下通过 ST-Link 加载到 SRAM 运行的最小 NuttX 系统（NSH shell + USART1 串口 + LED 控制）。\n\n### 后续计划（XSPI Flash 掉电保存）\n\n这是 Step 1（最小基线）。要实现外部 Flash 掉电保存，还需要：\n1. **XSPI 驱动** — 移植 `xspi.c` 到 NuttX 框架\n2. **VDDIO3 配置** — 1.8V 电源域 + BSEC OTP 熔丝\n3. **FSBL** — 第一阶段引导加载程序\n4. **XIP 链接脚本** — 从 Flash 执行 (`0x70080000`)\n5. **MTD + LittleFS** — Flash 分区和掉电保存文件系统\n\n要不要先尝试编译一下当前的基线配置？"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":307,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":109056,"output_tokens":801,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"4cdb4809-5582-4a95-aba1-84669c905c56","timestamp":"2026-08-21T03:10:52.125Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"2d4ac909-674d-4c60-84e6-9f60f265e8c3","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD"}
