{"parentUuid":"7ebd0660-79ef-4863-84ad-4dc1862545ff","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_644b3911305f4c6789d14e43","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## 构建完成！\n\n两个固件都已成功编译：\n\n| 固件 | 文件大小 | 链接地址 | 入口函数 |\n|------|---------|---------|---------|\n| **FSBL** | 39KB | `0x34180400` (SRAM2) | `fsbl_entry` |\n| **XIP** | 73KB | `0x70080000` (外部Flash) | `__start` |\n\n### 创建的文件\n\n| 文件 | 用途 |\n|------|------|\n| [stm32n6xxx_xspi.h](nuttx/arch/arm/src/stm32n6/hardware/stm32n6xxx_xspi.h) | XSPI 硬件寄存器定义 |\n| [stm32n6_xspi.c](nuttx/arch/arm/src/stm32n6/stm32n6_xspi.c) | XSPI2 驱动（初始化、Octal DTR、XIP） |\n| [stm32n6_xspi.h](nuttx/arch/arm/src/stm32n6/stm32n6_xspi.h) | XSPI 驱动头文件 |\n| [stm32_fsbl.c](vendor/openvela/boards/contest2026_224_board/src/stm32_fsbl.c) | FSBL 入口（配置电源、初始化XSPI、跳转应用） |\n| [fsbl.ld](vendor/openvela/boards/contest2026_224_board/scripts/fsbl.ld) | FSBL 链接脚本 |\n| [xip.ld](vendor/openvela/boards/contest2026_224_board/scripts/xip.ld) | XIP 链接脚本 |\n\n### 烧录流程\n\n```bash\n# 1. 烧录 FSBL 到外部 Flash 偏移 0\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI -c port=SWD -w build_fsbl/nuttx.bin 0x70000000\n\n# 2. 烧录 XIP 应用到外部 Flash 偏移 0x80000\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI -c port=SWD -w build_xip/nuttx.bin 0x70080000\n\n# 3. 复位板子\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI -c port=SWD -rst\n```\n\n### 启动流程\n\n```\n硬件 Boot ROM → 加载 FSBL 到 SRAM2 (0x34180400)\n    → FSBL 配置 VDDIO3 (1.8V)\n    → 初始化 XSPI2，切换 Flash 到 Octal DTR 模式\n    → 启用 Memory-Mapped XIP 模式\n    → 跳转到 0x70080000 运行主应用\n```"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":402,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":42688,"output_tokens":681,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"bd282d5c-3bc8-4567-bfaa-7ad525b78