{"parentUuid":"ec35c892-c22a-4d98-b81c-81f57d55c0b6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_5581455b5a60485a878d58a8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The LED functions are static so they won't appear in the System.map. The build succeeded. Let me provide a summary of what was added.","signature":""}],"usage":{"input_tokens":284,"output_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":54784}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"3d77d480-51df-4855-b51a-e681e177826d","timestamp":"2026-08-21T15:19:52.288Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela/nuttx","sessionId":"2d4ac909-674d-4c60-84e6-9f60f265e8c3","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"synthetic-wandering-llama"}
{"parentUuid":"3d77d480-51df-4855-b51a-e681e177826d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_5581455b5a60485a878d58a8","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"FSBL 构建成功！已添加 LED 闪烁功能。\n\n## LED 行为说明\n\n| 阶段 | LED 状态 | 含义 |\n|------|---------|------|\n| FSBL 启动 | 🟢 绿灯常亮 | FSBL 开始执行 |\n| VDD 配置完成 | 🔴 红灯闪烁 2 次 | 电源域配置成功 |\n| XSPI 初始化完成 | 🔵 蓝灯闪烁 3 次 | Flash 已切换到 Octal DTR 模式 |\n| 跳转应用前 | 🟢 绿灯熄灭 | 准备跳转到主程序 |\n\n## LED 引脚定义\n\n| LED | 引脚 | 开发板丝印 |\n|-----|------|-----------|\n| 红色 | PG10 | LD5 |\n| 绿色 | PG0 | LD6 |\n| 蓝色 | PG8 | LD7 |\n\n**注意**: LED 是低电平有效（GPIO LOW = LED 亮）\n\n## 烧录测试\n\n```bash\n# 烧录 FSBL\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI -c port=SWD -w build_fsbl/nuttx.bin 0x70000000\n\n# 复位后观察 LED:\n# 1. 绿灯亮 → FSBL 启动\n# 2. 红灯闪 2 次 → VDD 配置完成\n# 3. 蓝灯闪 3 次 → XSPI 就绪\n# 4. 绿灯灭 → 跳转到主应用\n```\n\n如果看到绿灯亮但没有后续闪烁，说明 FSBL 卡在 VDD 配置或 XSPI 初始化阶段。"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":284,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":54784,"output_tokens":425,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"9e4332c2-59b2-4fb6-a5ce-9264105b2661","timestamp":"2026-08-21T15:19:57.979Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela/nuttx","sessionId":"2d4ac909-674d-4c60-84e6-9f60f265e8c3","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"synthetic-wandering-llama"}
