{"parentUuid":"8a724ca1-40c9-4b4c-ad36-c1b15438d1d6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_e8f646207ff143a2a25f2fff","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is saying they need to use the external loader for the MX25UM51245G flash chip when programming. This is because the STM32N657 has no internal flash - the code runs from external XSPI flash, so the STM32CubeProgrammer needs to use a special external loader to write to the XSPI flash.\n\nLet me provide the correct command to flash the FSBL using the external loader.","signature":""}],"usage":{"input_tokens":524,"output_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":55040}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"52e4378d-4d4c-4dac-b9ad-13a1e28abe53","timestamp":"2026-08-21T15:33:38.339Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"2d4ac909-674d-4c60-84e6-9f60f265e8c3","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"synthetic-wandering-llama"}
{"parentUuid":"52e4378d-4d4c-4dac-b9ad-13a1e28abe53","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_e8f646207ff143a2a25f2fff","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"需要使用外部 Flash 加载器来烧录。正确命令：\n\n```bash\n# 烧录 FSBL 到外部 Flash（偏移 0）\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI -c port=SWD \\\n  -el \"/home/warner/STMicroelectronics/STM32Cube/STM32CubeProgrammer/bin/ExternalLoader/MX25UM51245G_STM32N6570-NUCLEO.stldr\" \\\n  -w build_fsbl/nuttx.bin 0x70000000 -rst\n```\n\n或者使用更完整的流程：\n\n```bash\n# 1. 连接目标并加载外部加载器\n# 2. 擦除 Flash（可选，首次烧录建议）\n# 3. 烧录 FSBL\n# 4. 复位\n\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI -c port=SWD \\\n  -el \"/home/warner/STMicroelectronics/STM32Cube/STM32CubeProgrammer/bin/ExternalLoader/MX25UM51245G_STM32N6570-NUCLEO.stldr\" \\\n  -e all \\\n  -w build_fsbl/nuttx.bin 0x70000000 \\\n  -rst\n```\n\n## 关键参数说明\n\n| 参数 | 含义 |\n|------|------|\n| `-c port=SWD` | SWD 调试接口 |\n| `-el <path>` | 加载外部 Flash 加载器 (.stldr) |\n| `-w <file> <addr>` | 写入文件到指定地址 |\n| `-e all` | 擦除整个外部 Flash |\n| `-rst` | 烧录后复位 |\n\n## 地址说明\n\n- **0x70000000**: XSPI2 外部 Flash 起始地址（Memory-Mapped 模式）\n- FSBL 放在 Flash 偏移 0（即 0x70000000）\n- 主应用放在偏移 0x80000（即 0x70080000）\n\n烧录后观察 LED：\n1. 🟢 绿灯亮 → FSBL 启动\n2. 🔴 红灯闪 2 次 → VDD 配置完成\n3. 🔵 蓝灯闪 3 次 → XSPI 就绪\n4. 🟢 绿灯灭 → 跳转主应用"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":524,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":55040,"output_tokens":662,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"1d5d05ba-83ad-4d51-89fa-8415541983bb","timestamp":"2026-08-21T15:33:46.159Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"2d4ac909-674d-4c60-84e6-9f60f265e8c3","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD","slu