{"parentUuid":"44efc265-6a95-4451-86ca-5fe3c30d867e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_6425f09c08394c7e8a534af7","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand! The key information is in lines 53-58. The correct command uses:\n- `-c port=SWD mode=HOTPLUG ap=1` - important: HOTPLUG mode and AP=1\n- `-el` for external loader- `-w` for writing\n- `-hardRst` for hard reset\n\nThe `mode=HOTPLUG` and `ap=1` parameters are crucial. HOTPLUG mode allows connecting to a running target without resetting it, and `ap=1` selects the correct access point.Also, the file needs to be a \"trusted\" firmware image with signing header. Let me check if our FSBL needs to be signed.\n\nActually, looking more carefully, the MicroPython uses a \"firmware-trusted.bin\" which is a signed image. The STM32N6 requires signed images for booting from external flash.\n\nBut for our FSBL, we're just testing if it works. Let me suggest the user try the HOTPLUG mode and AP=1 parameters first.","signature":""}],"usage":{"input_tokens":1291,"output_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":62528}},"type":"assistant","uuid":"c789d8b2-0bbb-4011-9e0d-0bd2d114c066","timestamp":"2026-08-21T15:35:51.013Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"2d4ac909-674d-4c60-84e6-9f60f265e8c3","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"synthetic-wandering-llama"}
{"parentUuid":"c789d8b2-0bbb-4011-9e0d-0bd2d114c066","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_6425f09c08394c7e8a534af7","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"找到关键信息了！需要使用 `mode=HOTPLUG ap=1` 参数：\n\n```bash\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI \\\n    -c port=SWD mode=HOTPLUG ap=1 \\\n    -el \"/home/warner/STMicroelectronics/STM32Cube/STM32CubeProgrammer/bin/ExternalLoader/MX25UM51245G_STM32N6570-NUCLEO.stldr\" \\\n    -w build_fsbl/nuttx.bin 0x70000000 \\\n    -hardRst\n```\n\n关键参数：\n- `mode=HOTPLUG` - 热插拔模式，不复位目标\n- `ap=1` - 选择正确的访问点\n- `-hardRst` - 硬复位\n\n## 注意事项\n\n根据文档，STM32N657 需要**签名的镜像**才能从外部 Flash 启动。如果上述命令仍然失败，可能需要：\n\n1. **检查芯片版本**（Rev Z 还是 Rev B）\n2. **使用 STM32 SigningTool 签名镜像**\n\n```bash\n# 签名 FSBL 镜像（假设 Rev Z，header version 2.1）\nSTM32_SigningTool_CLI \\\n    -bin build_fsbl/nuttx.bin \\\n    -nk -of 0x80000000 -t fsbl \\\n    -o build_fsbl/nuttx-trusted.bin \\\n    -hv 2.1 --align\n\n# 然后烧录签名后的镜像\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI \\\n    -c port=SWD mode=HOTPLUG ap=1 \\\n    -el \"/home/warner/STMicroelectronics/STM32Cube/STM32CubeProgrammer/bin/ExternalLoader/MX25UM51245G_STM32N6570-NUCLEO.stldr\" \\\n    -w build_fsbl/nuttx-trusted.bin 0x70000000 \\\n    -hardRst\n```"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":1291,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":62528,"output_tokens":696,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"c25e1c15-088a-4b0f-8822-fa49a0cc48b2","timestamp":"2026-08-21T15:35:56.484Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"2d4ac909-674d-4c60-84e6-9f60f265e8c3","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"synthetic-wandering-llama"}
