{"parentUuid":"24611ff1-8cb7-452c-af54-78c33e4414ee","isSidechain":false,"message":{"id":"msg_7d7a84aff35d4739bbd49564","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"mimo-v2.5-pro","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`ap=1` 连接失败。尝试不指定 AP，使用默认连接：\n\n```bash\n# 方法 1：使用默认 AP（不指定 ap=1）\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI \\\n    -c port=SWD mode=HOTPLUG \\\n    -el \"/home/warner/STMicroelectronics/STM32Cube/STM32CubeProgrammer/bin/ExternalLoader/MX25UM51245G_STM32N6570-NUCLEO.stldr\" \\\n    -w build_fsbl/nuttx-trusted.bin 0x70000000 \\\n    -hardRst\n```\n\n如果还是失败，尝试：\n\n```bash\n# 方法 2：使用 Under Reset 模式\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI \\\n    -c port=SWD mode=UR \\\n    -el \"/home/warner/STMicroelectronics/STM32Cube/STM32CubeProgrammer/bin/ExternalLoader/MX25UM51245G_STM32N6570-NUCLEO.stldr\" \\\n    -w build_fsbl/nuttx-trusted.bin 0x70000000 \\\n    -rst\n```\n\n或者：\n\n```bash\n# 方法 3：最简单的连接方式\nSTM32_Programmer_CLI \\\n    -c port=SWD \\\n    -el \"/home/warner/STMicroelectronics/STM32Cube/STM32CubeProgrammer/bin/ExternalLoader/MX25UM51245G_STM32N6570-NUCLEO.stldr\" \\\n    -w build_fsbl/nuttx-trusted.bin 0x70000000 \\\n    -rst\n```\n\n如果所有方法都失败，可能需要：\n1. 检查开发板上的跳线设置（BOOT 配置）\n2. 使用 STM32CubeProgrammer GUI 连接看看详细错误\n3. 确认 ST-LINK 固件是最新的"}],"usage":{"input_tokens":1153,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":63808,"output_tokens":577,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_details":null},"type":"assistant","uuid":"2b930dd7-6839-4908-bc73-d2feba68217c","timestamp":"2026-08-21T15:40:15.718Z","effort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/home/warner/openvela","sessionId":"2d4ac909-674d-4c60-84e6-9f60f265e8c3","version":"2.1.237","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"synthetic-wandering-llama"}
